  "description": "For the fourth year in a row, Jungsoo failed his college entrance exams. Shunned by family and friends as a failure in life, his one remaining joy is the pretty girl at cram school. But when a new hottie takes the seat next to him, Jungsoo can’t help but take notice —he’s fallen for a guy! Why can’t he stop gawking at this handsome boy? Will Jungsoo be able to concentrate and get into college this time? \n\n(Source: TappyToon)",
